 "wiki": {
  "title": "Whiskered tern",
  "extract": "The whiskered tern is a tern in the family Laridae. The genus name is from Ancient Greek khelidonios, \"swallow-like\", from khelidon, \"swallow\". The specific hybridus is Latin for hybrid; Peter Simon Pallas thought it might be a hybrid of white-winged black tern and common tern, writing \"Sterna fissipes [Chlidonias leucopterus] et Hirundine [Sterna hirundo] natam\".",
  "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Whiskered_tern",
  "revision": "1375762462"
